          {
            "url": "https://www.politico.com/story/2018/11/04/china-trump-tariffs-trade-960499",
            "title": "Trade war: Chinese exporters’ front-loading beats U.S. tariffs, ...",
            "snippets": [
              "As manufacturers operate flat-out to fulfill U.S. orders brought forward to avoid tariffs, the possibility of a sharp fall in demand in 2019 looms large.",
